@baseUrl = http://localhost:18081

### 先执行 auth-requests.http 的登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"HTTP 学习资料","description":"独立测试资料"}

> {% if (response.status === 201) client.global.set("kbId", response.body.id); %}

### 我的知识库
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 上传；boundary 与请求体保持一致
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases/{{kbId}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=RagentLearningBoundary

--RagentLearningBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="knowledge-demo.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ../examples/knowledge-demo.md
--RagentLearningBoundary--

> {% if (response.status === 201) client.global.set("docId", response.body.id); %}

### 解析原文件
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases/{{kbId}}/documents/{{docId}}/parse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 查看正文与处理状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases/{{kbId}}/documents/{{docId}}/text
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 下载只在请求头携带 Token，不放 URL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases/{{kbId}}/documents/{{docId}}/file
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 切分：先成功解析文档；相同原文/参数复用已有片段
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases/{{kbId}}/documents/{{docId}}/chunks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"chunkSize":800,"overlap":120}

### 按顺序分页查看正文片段及来源
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases/{{kbId}}/documents/{{docId}}/chunks?page=1&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Agent 单轮问答，先把相关资料解析、切分并向量化
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases/{{kbId}}/agent/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"星河学习项目每周什么时候验收？"}
